{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/node-logistics-s21/runs/eval-OPS-90-r1-instincts/portside-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"id": "toolu_01BpnTReuFQ1UnvdhDX2e9zw", "input": {"content": "---\nname: ops-90-urgent-first-sort-fix\ndescription: OPS-90 was a P1 bug where urgentFirst was sorting cargo priorities in ascending order instead of descending\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\n## OPS-90: Urgent cargo lists come out in the wrong order\n\n**Status:** Resolved on 2026-09-28\n\nThe `urgentFirst` function in `src/schedule.mjs` was sorting cargo entries by ascending priority (smallest first) when it should return them in descending order (largest first). This was a critical (P1) issue in the portside-dispatch terminal operations system.\n\n**Fix:** Changed the sort comparator in `urgentFirst` from `a.priority - b.priority` to `b.priority - a.priority`.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:** urgentFirst over entries with priority 1, 3, and 2 returns them in order 3, 2, 1 ✓\n\nCommit: a67840f\n", "file_path": "/sandbox/runs/node-logistics-s21/runs/eval-OPS-90-r1-instincts/home/.claude/projects/-sandbox-runs-eval-OPS-90-r1-instincts-portside-dispatch/memory/ops-90_urgent_first_sort.md"}, "name": "Write", "type": "tool_use"}], "id": "msg_011CfV9Sh8cDwf5n8BdReCki", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "role": "assistant"}, "sessionId": "ba2fd9ae-9181-44e6-b218-78049d8df1d8", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:42:52.102Z", "type": "assistant"}
{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/node-logistics-s21/runs/eval-OPS-90-r1-instincts/portside-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "File created successfully at: /sandbox/runs/node-logistics-s21/runs/eval-OPS-90-r1-instincts/home/.claude/projects/-sandbox-runs-eval-OPS-90-r1-instincts-portside-dispatch/memory/ops-90_urgent_first_sort.md", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_01BpnTReuFQ1UnvdhDX2e9zw", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "ba2fd9ae-9181-44e6-b218-78049d8df1d8", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:42:52.131Z", "toolUseResult": {"content": "---\nname: ops-90-urgent-first-sort-fix\ndescription: OPS-90 was a P1 bug where urgentFirst was sorting cargo priorities in ascending order instead of descending\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: ba2fd9ae-9181-44e6-b218-78049d8df1d8\n  modified: 2026-09-28T03:42:52.115Z\n---\n\n## OPS-90: Urgent cargo lists come out in the wrong order\n\n**Status:** Resolved on 2026-09-28\n\nThe `urgentFirst` function in `src/schedule.mjs` was sorting cargo entries by ascending priority (smallest first) when it should return them in descending order (largest first). This was a critical (P1) issue in the portside-dispatch terminal operations system.\n\n**Fix:** Changed the sort comparator in `urgentFirst` from `a.priority - b.priority` to `b.priority - a.priority`.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:** urgentFirst over entries with priority 1, 3, and 2 returns them in order 3, 2, 1 ✓\n\nCommit: a67840f\n"}, "type": "user"}
